OL,6,FThe Old Bailey previously heard that   
OL,7,Fthe teenager shouted "Allahu Akbar" as 
OL,8,Fhe attacked the boys and then declared:
OL,9,F"I'm not a kid any more, I'm a         
OL,10,Fsoldier," as he fled the scene.        
OL,12,FHe denies two counts of attempted      
OL,13,Fmurder.                                
